---START---
-- non-hashable type
set enable_hashagg to on;
---END---
---START---
explain (costs off)
select x from (values (100::money), (200::money)) _(x) union select x from (values (100::money), (300::money)) _(x);
                  QUERY PLAN                   
-----------------------------------------------
 Unique
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: "*VALUES*".column1
         ->  Append
               ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*"
               ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*_1"
(6 rows)

---END---
